```

#### Error responses

| Status | Condition | Response body |
|--------|-----------|---------------|
| `400` | Invalid `includeTemplateComponents` value | Validation error from API validator |
| `401` | Missing or invalid API key | `{ "message": "Unauthorized, please use your project api key" }` |
| `403` | IP not allowed | `{ "message": "This IP address (...)" }` |
| `500` | Server error | `{ "success": false, "message": "Failed to fetch WhatsApp resources" }` |

